(7727967, 1271781, 124815, '<td valign="top">Save for the man wearing a hat and some cropping on the right side, this could be a model for a mythical paintings of an Artemisia Gentileschi perhaps</td>', 'Save for the man wearing a hat and some cropping on the right side, this could be a model for a mythical paintings of an Artemisia Gentileschi perhaps', '2022-08-15 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
