(7727970, 1272306, 124815, '<td valign="top">My first thought was against the frame but...such it was and the chicken is a beauty.<br/>Wondering if you won''t try a different frame, considering an expert editing.<br/>But I like it a lot</td>', 'My first thought was against the frame but...such it was and the chicken is a beauty.Wondering if you won''t try a different frame, considering an expert editing.But I like it a lot', '2022-08-15 19:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
