(7728132, 1272296, 30049, '<td valign="top">This must have been exciting to see and capture.  :-)  Ummm ... where''s momma?!</td>', 'This must have been exciting to see and capture.  :-)  Ummm ... where''s momma?!', '2022-08-18 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728133, 1271716, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this candid shot and the B&amp;W treatment works well.  Don''t know if it would have worked well or not, but a little trim to reduce some of the excess height could have made the man a little more dominant in the frame?  Just thinking out loud.  Nice overall.</td>', 'I like this candid shot and the B&W treatment works well.  Don''t know if it would have worked well or not, but a little trim to reduce some of the excess height could have made the man a little more dominant in the frame?  Just thinking out loud.  Nice overall.', '2022-08-18 18:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728134, 1272334, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s nice, but does feel, to me, a bit off-balance.</td>', 'It''s nice, but does feel, to me, a bit off-balance.', '2022-08-18 18:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728135, 1272119, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, again.  :-)  Bummer when a nearly same capture ends up in back-to-back challenges.  May get dinged a smidge, or not ...</td>', 'Nice shot, again.  :-)  Bummer when a nearly same capture ends up in back-to-back challenges.  May get dinged a smidge, or not ...', '2022-08-18 18:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728136, 1272220, 30049, '<td valign="top">Creative presentation.  I''m guessing Anita?  :-)  If not, consider it a compliment.</td>', 'Creative presentation.  I''m guessing Anita?  :-)  If not, consider it a compliment.', '2022-08-18 18:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728137, 1272270, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool cars, and I like the starbursts you''ve picked up on the highlights.  Just seems a bit flat (low contrast) to me.  The B&amp;W works, but the levels could be pushed a bit for some darker blacks.  IMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool cars, and I like the starbursts you''ve picked up on the highlights.  Just seems a bit flat (low contrast) to me.  The B&W works, but the levels could be pushed a bit for some darker blacks.  IMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2022-08-18 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7728138, 1272325, 30049, '<td valign="top">Edgy!</td>', 'Edgy!', '2022-08-18 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
