(7728422, 1272306, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, standard editing.  I always forget that you can do weird things in extended, like change the frame!  This is a little window in a chicken coop at a VRBO I stayed at in Washington.  The girls were such sweethearts!  We got to carry them from their pen on the lawn back to their coop at the end of the day a time or two.<br/> <br/>Original:<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1272524" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1272524.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1272524.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1272524.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> <br/> <br/>Perspective correction and a crop.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-08-22 14:17:04.</i></td>', 'Yes, standard editing.  I always forget that you can do weird things in extended, like change the frame!  This is a little window in a chicken coop at a VRBO I stayed at in Washington.  The girls were such sweethearts!  We got to carry them from their pen on the lawn back to their coop at the end of the day a time or two. Original:   Perspective correction and a crop.', '2022-08-22 15:13:45.000000', '2022-08-22 15:17:04.000000', 0),
